      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The refinement path inheritance Yu Yi Ye Zi cultivates is called eight refinement gates. A certain generation fairy of Spirit Affinity House created a ninth gate on the foundation of that inheritance, and Zhao Lian Yun, as the current generation fairy, has the authority to take the true inheritance and give it to him.",
